__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.DS_Store
*.egg-info/

# Inflation Momentum Methodology Study (research/, not production):
# fetched raw FRED data and generated study outputs are both fully
# regenerable (fetch_data.py / study.py) from a live FRED credential --
# not committed as large, effectively-derived datasets. The study code
# itself, its tests, and STUDY_RESULTS.md ARE tracked.
research/inflation_momentum/data/
research/inflation_momentum/outputs/

# Frontend (frontend/, Increment #16A): installed packages and the
# production build are both fully regenerable (`npm install` /
# `npm run build`) -- not committed. frontend/.env.example IS tracked
# (a placeholder-only template); a real frontend/.env is developer-
# local and never committed, same discipline as the backend's own
# .env/.env.example pair.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.env
frontend/*.local
frontend/coverage/